# ─── WordPress dated blog/news/evidence URLs → new flat paths ────────────
# WP used /blog/YYYY/MM/DD/slug/. Netlify wildcard captures the slug and
# routes to the new category-based path. Category is inferred from the
# original path segment.
/blog/*/*/*/:slug                            /blog/:slug/               301
/news/*/*/*/:slug                            /news/:slug/               301
/evidence/*/*/*/:slug                        /evidence/:slug/           301

